      optsEn: ['Place heavy items on bottom, light/fragile on top, interlock upper cartons across 2 lower packages (brick stack), eliminate gaps, and obey This-Side-Up marks', 'Put fragile light boxes on the bottom in straight unbonded columns', 'Lay This-Side-Up cartons on their side to fill gaps', 'Allow overhang outside the contour and cinch the net tightly'],
