      optsEn: ['Lay spreader planks (shoring) and a pallet/skid to distribute floor load within limits and leave fork clearance, then secure with tie-down straps', 'Drop directly onto bare aluminum sheet without spreaders', 'Pry directly against the ULD floor panel with a steel crowbar', 'Place at one corner creating an eccentric load'],
