      optsEn: ['~53.4 m (175 ft at 25 m/s) aft exhaust hazard, ~140 kg suction force at idle (~460 kg at takeoff thrust), and watchman stays ≥5 m outside the engine nacelle', 'Only 3 m aft hazard and 5 kg suction', 'Stand 1 m beside cowling', 'Safe to walk in front of intake at idle'],
